1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:07,260
This is Episode 34.

3
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:09,680
Maya made lemonade.

4
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:13,776
She wants to tell Sammy, Eddie and Lulu.

5
00:00:13,776 --> 00:00:16,409
She runs to one house.

6
00:00:16,409 --> 00:00:18,417
Then the next.

7
00:00:18,417 --> 00:00:20,425
Then the next.

8
00:00:20,425 --> 00:00:22,021
Oh no!

9
00:00:22,021 --> 00:00:24,441
Sammy wandered off.

10
00:00:24,441 --> 00:00:26,609
Eddie never heard.

11
00:00:26,609 --> 00:00:29,268
Here comes the town horn.

12
00:00:29,268 --> 00:00:32,154
Maya taps the post once.

13
00:00:32,154 --> 00:00:35,079
The horn calls one time.

14
00:00:35,079 --> 00:00:37,247
Sammy hears it.

15
00:00:37,247 --> 00:00:39,215
Eddie hears it.

16
00:00:39,215 --> 00:00:41,369
Lulu hears it.

17
00:00:41,369 --> 00:00:43,936
All at the same moment.

18
00:00:43,936 --> 00:00:46,449
Everyone comes running.

19
00:00:46,449 --> 00:00:49,295
Maya does not run anymore.

20
00:00:49,295 --> 00:00:53,364
Say it once, and every friend hears it.

21
00:00:53,364 --> 00:00:55,904
That is the town horn.

22
00:00:55,904 --> 00:00:58,497
Now you know SNS!

23
00:00:58,497 --> 00:01:03,191
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

